{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Phantasms is an episodic psychological horror game. Each chapter is hand crafted to deliver a unique and immersive horror experience. <br><br>More episodes are coming soon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Phantasms: Maledictus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this medieval-themed first episode, you play as a parent whose child has been abducted by a mysterious figure. You\u2019ll face multiple possible outcomes, though <strong>only one leads to the correct ending.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylized PSX graphics with a horror aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VHS film shaders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple endings in this interactive story telling experience.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566420?t=1741717813","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566420?t=1741717813","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566420/bcefc81a2207587b4c2d8674c3c23204010a1842/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741717813","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566420/bcefc81a2207587b4c2d8674c3c23204010a1842/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741717813","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Phantasms is an episodic psychological horror game. Each chapter is hand crafted to deliver a unique and immersive horror experience. <br><br>More episodes are coming soon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Phantasms: Maledictus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this medieval-themed first episode, you play as a parent whose child has been abduc